# SAM build source-copy exclusions (Task 39). SAM copies the CodeUri
# (repository root) into each function's build sandbox; this file keeps the
# copy bounded by excluding build artifacts, caches, and local-only data.
# Secret files are already gitignored and never copied.
target/
**/target/
node_modules/
**/node_modules/
dist/
**/dist/
.aws-sam/
.git/
.pi/
.pi-subagents/
graphify-out/
temp/
infrastructure/local/data/
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
docs/sample-quotation.pdf
